WEBVTT

00:01:49.209 --> 00:01:51.587
Baki! You're alive?!

00:01:51.611 --> 00:01:54.524
You're horrible, Strydom.

00:01:54.548 --> 00:01:57.927
Why'd you send me into
such a dangerous place?

00:01:57.951 --> 00:01:59.329
Um, well...

00:01:59.353 --> 00:02:04.621
I should tell him that you beat Gaia...

00:02:07.794 --> 00:02:09.772
Baki beat Gaia?

00:02:09.796 --> 00:02:15.758
You know that Gaia's
strength rivals your own.

00:02:16.636 --> 00:02:23.906
You believe that too? Battlefields
are like amusement parks to me.

00:02:25.612 --> 00:02:31.312
If I wanted to, I could easily take
the life of a country"s leader.

00:02:32.619 --> 00:02:34.564
Prime Minister's estate?

00:02:34.588 --> 00:02:39.168
In one hour's time, I will come
pulverize the prime minister.

00:02:39.192 --> 00:02:41.170
What are you doing?!

00:02:41.194 --> 00:02:45.341
I'll show you what real violence is.

00:02:45.365 --> 00:02:51.361
"Bite Marks"

00:02:56.443 --> 00:03:02.091
Team A, take position inside.
Team B, remain in front!

00:03:02.115 --> 00:03:06.229
The guy should show up any minute now!

00:03:06.253 --> 00:03:09.465
Primary objective is to
control him! The secondary--

00:03:09.489 --> 00:03:12.424
Captain...! Is that...?

00:03:13.693 --> 00:03:17.006
Is the Prime Minister here?

00:03:17.030 --> 00:03:19.242
What business might you have with him?

00:03:19.266 --> 00:03:24.432
Don't play dumb. I told you
I'd come wipe the floor with him.

00:03:26.106 --> 00:03:29.098
Come here...!

00:03:33.613 --> 00:03:38.517
Oh my. Did you trip all by yourself?

00:03:52.732 --> 00:03:55.167
Retreat! Retreat!

00:04:00.006 --> 00:04:04.420
That's it. Gather 'round.

00:04:04.444 --> 00:04:09.177
Quit your useless resistance!
You're completely surrounded!

00:04:11.585 --> 00:04:15.998
You think you can stop me
with just 20 or 30 people?

00:04:16.022 --> 00:04:19.302
You'd need at least a hundred.

00:04:19.326 --> 00:04:23.639
Stop your resistance at once
and do as we say!

00:04:23.663 --> 00:04:25.563
Perfect.

00:04:44.851 --> 00:04:48.014
He's pushing back 100 people...!

00:04:57.330 --> 00:04:58.559
Halt!

00:05:15.582 --> 00:05:19.712
Your security needs some improvement,
Prime Minister.

00:05:22.722 --> 00:05:25.054
Thank you for your counsel...

00:05:33.767 --> 00:05:38.261
You can't rest easy
with such dumb security.

00:05:45.779 --> 00:05:47.890
--Sir!
--Are you all right?!

00:05:47.914 --> 00:05:50.960
<i>Sir! Sir!</i>

00:05:50.984 --> 00:05:54.130
--Listen...
--Yes?!

00:05:54.154 --> 00:05:57.818
I'm already dead.

00:06:03.597 --> 00:06:08.077
--That's hilarious!
--It's no laughing matter, Madam.

00:06:08.101 --> 00:06:13.403
The police chief and dozens of
top officials have been replaced.

00:06:15.742 --> 00:06:18.921
This was too much,
even for Yujiro-sama...

00:06:18.945 --> 00:06:21.557
It's alright, he won't be caught.

00:06:21.581 --> 00:06:24.160
What the top brass fear most

00:06:24.184 --> 00:06:29.816
is the fact that one person
can take on the entire nation.

00:06:31.658 --> 00:06:36.872
And the day this is leaked to the media,
he'll be an instant hero.

00:06:36.896 --> 00:06:42.164
He'd likely be acquitted in light
of the bad influence on the youth.

00:06:43.136 --> 00:06:50.839
He's trying to respond to
Baki in his own unique way.

00:06:52.012 --> 00:06:55.124
| can't wait to see their fight...!

00:06:55.148 --> 00:06:59.395
Are you not worried about Baki-sama?

00:06:59.419 --> 00:07:02.531
Yujiro Hanma is the
strongest man in the world.

00:07:02.555 --> 00:07:06.535
Any woman would do anything for him.

00:07:06.559 --> 00:07:10.393
He's more important
than any parental bond.

00:07:15.001 --> 00:07:16.646
Baki...

00:07:16.670 --> 00:07:19.799
What will you do for his sake?

00:07:47.400 --> 00:07:49.278
I couldn't see it...!

00:07:49.302 --> 00:07:53.049
I only realized it once he finished.

00:07:53.073 --> 00:07:54.684
Well, Baki-kun?

00:07:54.708 --> 00:07:57.853
Were you able to predict
when I would cut it?

00:07:57.877 --> 00:08:00.089
Not one bit...

00:08:00.113 --> 00:08:04.060
Of course, this is partly because
of the lightning-quick iai technique,

00:08:04.084 --> 00:08:08.197
but that's not all. It's mostly this.

00:08:08.221 --> 00:08:11.300
The handle's weight and
the razor-sharp edge...

00:08:11.324 --> 00:08:14.624
It's what every good
Japanese sword strives to be.

00:08:17.864 --> 00:08:19.809
| haven't seen Mr. Yujiro in some time,

00:08:19.833 --> 00:08:22.812
but I think he would concede
that the Japanese sword

00:08:22.836 --> 00:08:25.567
is superior at shedding blood.

00:08:28.375 --> 00:08:32.403
Kurokawa-san... Can you try it on me?

00:08:34.347 --> 00:08:37.840
Or are you afraid to face me?!

00:08:48.161 --> 00:08:50.172
I am.

00:08:50.196 --> 00:08:53.909
A person driven into a corner
is completely unpredictable.

00:08:53.933 --> 00:08:59.770
| cannot fight you. Now go home.

00:09:13.420 --> 00:09:15.164
Go home!

00:09:15.188 --> 00:09:19.068
Martial artists are such
a pain at times like this.

00:09:19.092 --> 00:09:21.404
No matter how much they refuse to fight,

00:09:21.428 --> 00:09:25.474
when they're attacked, they have
to fight with all their might.

00:09:25.498 --> 00:09:27.364
Isn't that right, Kurokawa-san?!

00:09:28.435 --> 00:09:29.812
Absurd...!

00:09:29.836 --> 00:09:36.242
This boy is as skilled as
a seriously-trained expert?!

00:09:37.844 --> 00:09:39.744
As things stand...

00:09:43.983 --> 00:09:45.849
Very well.

00:09:55.929 --> 00:09:59.524
He looks twice as strong
with the sword on!

00:10:00.834 --> 00:10:04.046
Baki-kun. I assume you understand

00:10:04.070 --> 00:10:08.551
that you will be cut the
instant you're within distance?

00:10:08.575 --> 00:10:11.067
Same goes for you.

00:10:11.978 --> 00:10:16.826
Come no closer!
You'll be more than injured!

00:10:16.850 --> 00:10:22.298
I'm glad I came!
He's just as forceful as he is!

00:10:22.322 --> 00:10:26.088
Time for my secret weapon!

00:10:30.430 --> 00:10:33.509
You wish to win that badly?!

00:10:33.533 --> 00:10:38.164
Yup. I never meant to win unharmed!

00:10:39.005 --> 00:10:43.552
-I'm fighting Yujiro Hanma tomorrow!
--What...?!

00:10:43.576 --> 00:10:47.690
Don't hold back once I'm close enough!

00:10:47.714 --> 00:10:51.173
Don't worry. That's what
sword fighting is all about!

00:10:52.819 --> 00:10:58.501
Only one chance. He'll still
be too far once he moves.

00:10:58.525 --> 00:11:01.984
The moment the blade touches my body...!

00:11:04.297 --> 00:11:06.391
Half a toenail more...

00:11:10.737 --> 00:11:11.898
Forgive me!

00:11:44.938 --> 00:11:45.962
Forgive me!

00:11:57.116 --> 00:11:58.675
Baki-kun...

00:12:00.019 --> 00:12:03.766
It seems I've really kept you waiting...

00:12:03.790 --> 00:12:07.670
Say, you shouldn't be unscathed either...

00:12:07.694 --> 00:12:14.109
| used some ointment that a
mercenary group gave me earlier.

00:12:14.133 --> 00:12:16.727
This boy is...!

00:12:18.204 --> 00:12:21.250
Should I be grateful you're unharmed,
or should I be ashamed

00:12:21.274 --> 00:12:25.177
of my own ineptitude that
allowed you to be unharmed?

00:12:26.713 --> 00:12:31.173
--You, if anyone, can do it.
--Thank you very much!

00:12:45.098 --> 00:12:49.845
To think that lad has grown
strong enough to fight you...

00:12:49.869 --> 00:12:51.981
It won't be a fight.

00:12:52.005 --> 00:12:56.340
It'll be like taking candy from a baby.

00:12:58.444 --> 00:13:00.689
You're the same as ever!

00:13:00.713 --> 00:13:05.894
Fighting a god... Fighting people...
Fighting your son...

00:13:05.918 --> 00:13:11.333
If fighting is peace,
and peace is simply boring to you,

00:13:11.357 --> 00:13:13.883
--then what is strife?
--Bitter!

00:13:16.029 --> 00:13:21.010
You talk a lot, but your
body doesn't seem rusty.

00:13:21.034 --> 00:13:25.447
Enough banter. I want you
to do something for me.

00:13:25.471 --> 00:13:29.885
--What can I possibly do?
--Don't play dumb.

00:13:29.909 --> 00:13:34.142
Do you think I'm here to
drink your disgusting tea?

00:13:37.150 --> 00:13:43.032
| drew up the blueprints
and had a friend make it for me.

00:13:43.056 --> 00:13:46.935
To draw the string back
requires 200 kg of force.

00:13:46.959 --> 00:13:50.506
Unfortunately, only I can do it.

00:13:50.530 --> 00:13:55.844
Its arrows are custom-made
from a titanium alloy.

00:13:55.868 --> 00:14:00.806
Kanemoto. You're a lot livelier
than when you got us the tea.

00:14:03.009 --> 00:14:06.343
--Have you ever tried it out?
--Yes.

00:14:09.115 --> 00:14:12.628
I killed this elk in Canada last year.

00:14:12.652 --> 00:14:16.398
There's a small hole in its forehead.

00:14:16.422 --> 00:14:21.622
I shot it in the rear, but it
went clean through the body.

00:14:22.795 --> 00:14:24.490
Kanemoto.

00:14:25.598 --> 00:14:29.178
Will you shoot me with it?

00:14:29.202 --> 00:14:32.681
You don't seem to be joking.

00:14:32.705 --> 00:14:34.434
Nope.

00:14:43.249 --> 00:14:45.081
That's far enough.

00:14:46.686 --> 00:14:50.145
There's no point if it's any further.

00:14:51.824 --> 00:14:54.919
I'I kill you if I feel
you're holding back.

00:15:26.692 --> 00:15:31.960
Pathetically slow. It's all looks.

00:15:49.982 --> 00:15:54.630
--Yo, Baki.
--0ld man...

00:15:54.654 --> 00:15:57.566
Been a while.

00:15:57.590 --> 00:16:00.719
<i>Was getting worried;
hadn't seen ya around lately.</i>

00:16:03.663 --> 00:16:09.411
Been gettin' yourself big scars
to show no one again?

00:16:09.435 --> 00:16:15.169
Why do you do it? It's not nice
to make your old lady cry.

00:16:17.677 --> 00:16:20.169
Pick up your cigarette butts!

00:16:23.749 --> 00:16:28.448
Geez. Your wounds sure are deep.

00:16:40.666 --> 00:16:45.047
I can finally give him
the present tomorrow.

00:16:45.071 --> 00:16:47.597
The greatest present known as Baki.

00:16:48.975 --> 00:16:52.673
--You can leave.
--Yes, Madam.

00:16:55.715 --> 00:17:00.380
Is this- Is this really all right?

00:17:03.456 --> 00:17:04.855
! have no choice...

00:18:01.714 --> 00:18:05.294
Emi. Don't get the wrong idea.

00:18:05.318 --> 00:18:08.530
You can think about sex if you want,

00:18:08.554 --> 00:18:16.071
but if Baki isn't up to snuff tomorrow,
you'll be nothing but leftovers.

00:18:16.095 --> 00:18:19.030
Assume you have no relations with me.

00:18:29.508 --> 00:18:31.169
I'll stay the night here.

00:18:32.578 --> 00:18:33.704
Leave!

00:18:45.091 --> 00:18:49.858
Madam! What's happened to you?!

00:18:53.399 --> 00:18:58.769
--What are you-
--Forgive me! I asked him-

00:19:12.218 --> 00:19:16.565
Why? Why won't he fall in love with me?!

00:19:16.589 --> 00:19:19.786
Do I have no womanly charm?!

00:19:23.429 --> 00:19:24.863
Mom...

00:19:27.633 --> 00:19:33.215
Because you're weak!
It's because you're so weak!

00:19:33.239 --> 00:19:40.088
It's your fault! Why did
I have such a weak child?!

00:19:40.112 --> 00:19:41.323
Emi-san!

00:19:41.347 --> 00:19:45.660
What kind of mother treats
such a diligent son this way?!

00:19:45.684 --> 00:19:49.898
--It's alright, Kuriyagawa-san...
--Master Baki...

00:19:49.922 --> 00:19:51.266
Mom...

00:19:51.290 --> 00:19:59.290
| know that you love him more
than me, more than anyone...

00:20:02.034 --> 00:20:08.984
| know that I'm making
you sad because I'm weak...

00:20:09.008 --> 00:20:17.008
But if I beat him,
will you finally love me?

00:20:20.719 --> 00:20:24.053
--Love me...!
--Idiot!

00:20:31.197 --> 00:20:34.443
Just a tiny bit of your love for him...

00:20:34.467 --> 00:20:37.664
Please... Love--

00:20:43.642 --> 00:20:44.803
Madam!

00:20:46.479 --> 00:20:48.072
Madam!

00:20:51.283 --> 00:20:53.615
I refuse to lose!

00:21:08.868 --> 00:21:11.132
What's up with that?

00:21:12.938 --> 00:21:14.337
Hey...!

00:21:17.510 --> 00:21:21.123
What's your problem, creep?

00:21:21.147 --> 00:21:23.275
Why, you!

00:21:45.771 --> 00:21:47.603
Hanayama-san...

00:22:45.030 --> 00:22:50.579
The hazy afternoon in the winter sun

00:22:50.603 --> 00:22:56.184
hangs onto love in one
corner of the pavement

00:22:56.208 --> 00:23:01.856
When I blew on my cold hands

00:23:01.880 --> 00:23:06.861
a tiny bit of courage swelled up.

00:23:06.885 --> 00:23:12.400
Today will certainly be wonderful,

00:23:12.424 --> 00:23:17.939
gently enveloped in love

00:23:17.963 --> 00:23:23.612
There are some strange feelings too,

00:23:23.636 --> 00:23:29.150
but they will be reborn

00:23:29.174 --> 00:23:34.823
Today will certainly be wonderful;

00:23:34.847 --> 00:23:40.581
they will be reborn as even more love.

00:23:50.329 --> 00:23:52.161
"Next Episode”

00:23:54.967 --> 00:23:59.414
The day has come. They've all
assembled because of a bond.

00:23:59.438 --> 00:24:02.317
The extraordinary brawler.
The prodigious boxer.

00:24:02.341 --> 00:24:04.519
The battlefield hunters.

00:24:04.543 --> 00:24:08.423
The men exchange blows,
confident that they'll be victorious.

00:24:08.447 --> 00:24:10.191
And then he comes.

00:24:10.215 --> 00:24:13.728
The boy thinks of his mother. It begins.

00:24:13.752 --> 00:24:15.196
He will beat his father.

00:24:15.220 --> 00:24:20.090
"Next Episode: Challenge!”
